# Muse Code must never read, index or send these. Same syntax as .gitignore.
# Muse Code may run in contributor mode, where what it reads can be used for training (AGENTS.md rule 1),
# so secrets and private material stay out of its reach. Work from a fresh clone where possible: it has none of these.

# Secrets: API keys (Meta), Supabase keys, the kid-session secret
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
.vercel/
supabase/.temp/
supabase/.branches/

# Private source material (the founder's raw tutor skills and the real-name map). It lives outside this
# repository; these lines guard against a copy ever landing here.
content-private/
mykx-prv/
**/names.json
*.skill

# Claude Code session files and its local work branches
.claude/

# Build output and caches (noise, and they can embed environment values)
.next/
node_modules/
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
scripts/soak/out/
